ie części: w pierwszej przedstawił losy młodego Don Vito, zagranego bezbłędnie przez Roberta De Niro, w drugiej -  przejmowanie przez Michaela (Al Pacino) władzy w mafijnej rodzinie. Ponownie, gromadząc na planie wielu znakomitych artystów, Coppola stworzył bez wątpienia najlepszy sequel w dziejach kina.","popularity":35.9794,"poster_path":"/sWQjhhK9AidSLExyn7M26Tz4V6U.jpg","release_date":"1974-12-20","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":8.57,"vote_count":14121,"character":"Child on Ship (uncredited)","credit_id":"55c0e9929251410f27002014","order":71},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/g1h6VasIJ7oghdVIdbXuTNsv3M6.jpg","genre_ids":[99,10402],"id":283462,"title":"Beastie Boys: Video Anthology","original_language":"en","original_title":"Beastie Boys: Video Anthology","overview":"","popularity":1.0346,"poster_path":"/4PEZeZDttLdq80MYfdwMq3TKavw.jpg","release_date":"2000-11-21","softcore":false,"video":true,"vote_average":7.3,"vote_count":25,"character":"Britney (uncredited)","credit_id":"567ac21292514106f5002b10","order":12},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99,10402],"id":65686,"title":"Beastie Boys Solid Gold Hits","original_language":"en","original_title":"Beastie Boys Solid Gold Hits","overview":"","popularity":0.9351,"poster_path":"/vq3kDrlba9eOLaG8GiN4E7p55Or.jpg","release_date":"2005-11-08","softcore":false,"video":true,"vote_average":4.6,"vote_count":4,"character":"Britney (uncredited)","credit_id":"56f0c41f9251411844001ac5","order":12},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/c1vrJxyuKhswMm9IbRJJhsFXm0I.jpg","genre_ids":[99,10770],"id":56205,"title":"The Godfather Family: A Look Inside","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Godfather Family: A Look Inside","overview":"","popularity":1.69,"poster_path":"/jDdybr7reoVABPthX9OSlazvncD.jpg","release_date":"1990-07-12","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.791,"vote_count":43,"character":"Self / Mary Corleone","credit_id":"571f728592514164b200044b","order":3},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":447397,"title":"Il était une fois.... « Lost in Translation »","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Il était une fois.... « Lost in Translation »","overview":"","popularity":0.7052,"poster_path":"/wCodk7eQDnbTpy3SO4JD0HRTab1.jpg","release_date":"2015-08-19","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.0,"vote_count":2,"character":"Self","credit_id":"667e69cc592d620536d7af32","order":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[35,14,10770],"id":368354,"title":"The Princess Who Had Never Laughed","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Princess Who Had Never Laughed","overview":"","popularity":0.8239,"poster_path":"/bRXYnkjI62dogNPq5dLU0e27lIl.jpg","release_date":"1986-08-11","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":8.0,"vote_count":1,"character":"Gwendolyn (as Domino Coppola)","credit_id":"57ee2b81c3a3684d9a003b98","order":3},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/uoGTKAi4qTk4lfOlbSkVKZA72lG.jpg","genre_ids":[35,18],"id":27834,"title":"CQ","original_language":"en","original_title":"CQ","overview":"W 1969 roku, w Paryżu, Paul, młody Amerykanin, pragnie zostać filmowcem. Planuje nakręcić filmowy pamiętnik w stylu „cinéma vérité” ze swojego życia. Obecnie Paul jest montażystą filmu „Dragonfly”, fabularnego filmu science fiction, którego akcja rozgrywa się w 2001 roku: piękna Valentine gra główną rolę, ubrana w różową skórę. Reżyser „Dragonfly” to ekstrawagancki twórca. Jego namiętność do Valentine wpływa na jego osąd, zwłaszcza jeśli chodzi o zakończenie filmu. Zniesmaczony Enzo, producent, zwalnia filmowca i zatrudnia na jego miejsce młodego i aroganckiego, cudownego reżysera, Felixa De Marco. Paul zazdrości mu sukcesu, ale po wypadku samochodowym Felix wycofuje się. Enzo prosi Paula o ratowanie zdjęć do filmu. Pomimo strachu, zgadza się.","popularity":4.3595,"poster_path":"/aFAPOT77Jh7lNWYtojC6nxi4CpJ.jpg","release_date":"2001-05-12","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.905,"vote_count":74,"character":"Enzo's Mistress","credit_id":"592ba9969251413ba0065434","order":12},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/8vroa5RYUxD7Nv7vUGUoxZTyz7P.jpg","genre_ids":[80,18],"id":2148,"title":"Cotton Club","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Cotton Club","overview":"Tytułowy \"Cotton Club\" jest nie tylko popularnym klubem jazzowym, ale również miejscem, w którym krzyżują się drogi mafijnych bossów. Tu załatwia się ciemne interesy, prowadzi negocjacje. Młody, świetnie zapowiadający się muzyk jazzowy, Dixi Dwyer pewnej nocy przypadkowo ratuje życie jednemu z najgroźniejszych gangsterów w mieście, Dutchowi Schultzowi. Wdzięczny Dutch proponuje mu pracę. Wkrótce Dixie zakochuje się w kochance gangstera i tak zaczynają się jego kłopoty.","popularity":3.2091,"poster_path":"/tLq6OzzyQS1AEh9jdSWbnm0x2j6.jpg","release_date":"1984-12-14","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.5,"vote_count":449,"character":"Child in Street","credit_id":"592babe7c3a36877df070bb4","order":29},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/eC5ds4bW1bH9nsagdHeWYfuXw5O.jpg","genre_ids":[35,878],"id":57476,"title":"The Spirit of '76","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Spirit of '76","overview":"","popularity":1.3065,"poster_path":"/bmRrkQPeCLuiiB6LmqiCreTAZUm.jpg","release_date":"1990-10-12","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":4.6,"vote_count":13,"character":"Girl in Parade","credit_id":"592bae469251413b540693a8","order":18},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/92KFwnzopzu3djn9ZSlKmUJjIMP.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":200063,"title":"Sunset Strip","original_language":"en","original_title":"Sunset Strip","overview":"","popularity":1.0432,"poster_path":"/iUtn31GVCEKszL4nMulNF23Bnma.jpg","release_date":"2012-03-16","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.3,"vote_count":30,"character":"Self","credit_id":"592bb21e9251413b4507035a","order":1},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/A5VWK3aPhMUbEyKkOKdSrZr70JL.jpg","genre_ids":[35],"id":452460,"title":"Torrance Rises","original_language":"en","origina